{
  "uid": "formula-runtime",
  "title": "Formula AI 运行日志",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "timezone": "browser",
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "如何排查一次操作",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "[自动错误中心](/d/formula-errors) · 1. 在下方查看 API、Worker、Python 的业务日志。\n2. 点开日志，展开 TraceID 链接可查看调用链。\n3. 已有 trace ID：打开 Explore，选择 Formula Traces，输入完整 trace ID 查询。\n\n日志搜索：`{service=~\"formula-.+\"} | json | traceId = \"你的编号\"`\n\n仅收集经过白名单过滤的业务诊断；不采集原始请求正文、Cookie、密钥和图片。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "各服务业务日志",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "formula-loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 18
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "{service=~\"formula-.+\"}",
          "queryType": "range"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "showLabels": true,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "enableLogDetails": true
      }
    }
  ]
}
